" --- Format / filter buffer (,= group) ---
" jq requires jq.exe on %PATH%. In a Visual mapping ':' ALREADY inserts
" '<,'>, so the Visual variants must NOT spell the range again.
nnoremap <silent> <leader>=j <Cmd>%!jq<CR>
