nmap <silent> [g <Plug>(ale_previous_wrap)
nmap <silent> ]g <Plug>(ale_next_wrap)

" --- Visual-selection search and replace (see s:VSetSearch) ---
xnoremap <silent> * :<C-u>call <SID>VSetSearch('/')<CR>/<C-R><C-R>=@/<CR><CR>
xnoremap <silent> # :<C-u>call <SID>VSetSearch('?')<CR>?<C-R><C-R>=@/<CR><CR>
" NOT <silent>: the command line has to stay on screen for the replacement.
